FRONTEND REQUIREMENTS
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Backend API contract for all frontend pages and components.
Maps each page/component to the endpoints it needs, what's already implemented,
and what's missing or needs a backend change.
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

LEGEND
  [/] endpoint exists and works
  [~] endpoint exists but needs a change (noted inline)
  [ ] endpoint does not exist — needs to be built
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

PAGE: / (Landing page)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Components: Hero, Problems, TechnicalApproach, UnitEconomics, CTA, Navbar, Footer

  Hero — waitlist form
    [/] GET  /api/waitlist          — Next.js route (Supabase, not backend)
    [/] POST /api/waitlist          — Next.js route (Supabase, not backend)
    NOTE: waitlist is handled entirely in Next.js API routes. No backend needed.

  Hero — live stats (optional enhancement)
    [ ] GET  /registry/stats        — already exists but not wired to landing page
        Returns: { totalAPIs, chainConnected, network }
        Frontend could show "X APIs registered" live counter in hero section.

  No other landing page sections require backend data.

