PAGE: /provider  (Provider portal — requires wallet connection)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  [/] GET  /provider/:address              — overview: earnings, APIs, call stats
        Returns: provider.{ usdcBalance, totalEarningsUsd, totalCalls,
                             activeApis, totalApis }, apis[], recentCalls[]

  [/] GET  /provider/:address/earnings     — earnings breakdown per API
        Returns: totalEarningsUsd, totalCalls, breakdown[]

  [/] GET  /provider/:address/calls        — paginated call history
        Query params: ?page=1 ?limit=20
        Returns: calls[], pagination.{ page, limit, total, pages }

  [/] GET  /payment/balance/:address       — USDC balance for wallet display

  REGISTER AN API button — currently no-op, needs:
  [ ] POST /registry/register              — register new API on-chain
        Body: { name, endpoint, pricePerCall }
        Exists in backend but frontend has no form/modal wired to it.
        Frontend needs: registration modal → POST /registry/register → get apiId
        → POST /registry/metadata/:apiId → submit docs/category/slug

  [ ] POST /registry/metadata/:id          — submit rich metadata after registration
        Exists in backend. Frontend registration flow needs to call this
        after on-chain registration to populate category, tags, description, etc.

  UPDATE API — price/active toggle per endpoint row:
  [ ] PUT  /registry/api/:id               — update price or active status
        Body: { pricePerCall?, active? }
        Exists in backend. Frontend needs edit controls per API row.

  FAUCET — for testnet, show "Get test USDC" button:
  [/] GET  /faucet/status/:address         — check cooldown + balance
        Returns: { eligible, cooldownSeconds, usdcBalance, faucetAmount }

  [/] POST /faucet/mint                    — mint 1000 MockUSDC
        Body: { address }
        Returns: { txHash, explorerUrl, amount }

