BACKEND CHANGES NEEDED (summary)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  1. CORS — allow X-Payment header:
        app.use(cors({ allowedHeaders: ['Content-Type', 'X-Payment'] }))

  2. Search — add ?search= to GET /registry/apis:
        Filter by name/description in the merged response

  3. Paginated recent calls per API — new endpoint:
        GET /registry/api/:id/calls?page=1&limit=20
        Returns paginated ledger entries for a specific apiId

  4. GATEWAY_URL env var — set to deployed URL (not localhost) before production:
        Used by autoRegisterBuiltins() to register internal feed endpoints
        Current default: http://localhost:3001
        Required: set GATEWAY_URL=https://your-deployed-backend.com in .env
